member.summary:
Gets the XML representation of the display units for each map in the project.

Format: Key=LocationUnit[n] Value="MapPath;LocationDisplayUnitXML";
        Key=ElevationUnit[n] Value="MapPath;LinearDisplayUnitXML";

  MapPath                 - The CIM path to the map
  LocationUnitXML         - XML string representing the map's location unit
  ElevationUnitXML        - XML string representing the map's elevation unit (for Scenes)

